<div class="space-y-6">

  <!-- Weekly Iteration Cycle -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Your Weekly Iteration Cycle</h3>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-blue-600 text-white rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold">BUILD</h4>
          <span class="text-sm bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Monday-Wednesday</span>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold">Pick ONE feature or improvement</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">Based on last week's feedback. The smallest possible version that tests the hypothesis.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold">Ship in 3-5 days MAX</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">If it takes longer, scope it down. Scrappy beats perfect.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold">Announce to users immediately</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">Email, in-app message, or personal note to your 10 power users.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-purple-600 text-white rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold">MEASURE</h4>
          <span class="text-sm bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Thursday</span>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold">Track 1-3 key metrics</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-purple-100">Usage of new feature, impact on activation/retention, user satisfaction score</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold">Talk to 5-10 users</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-purple-100">"What do you think of [feature]? Did you use it? Why/why not? What would make it better?"</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold">Document everything</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-purple-100">Screenshots, quotes, metrics. Build your knowledge base.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-green-600 text-white rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold">LEARN</h4>
          <span class="text-sm bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Friday</span>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold">Analyze results</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-green-100">Did it move the needle? What surprised you? What did users love/hate?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold">Make a decision</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-green-100">🚀 Double down | 🔄 Iterate | ❌ Kill it</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold">Plan next week's experiment</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-green-100">What's the next biggest assumption to test?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Red Flags vs Good Signs -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-red-200">
      <h4 class="font-bold text-red-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.707 7.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414L8.586 10l-1.293 1.293a1 1 0 101.414 1.414L10 11.414l1.293 1.293a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L11.414 10l1.293-1.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L10 8.586 8.707 7.293z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Red Flags
      </h4>
      <ul class="text-sm text-red-900 space-y-2">
        <li>❌ Building for weeks without user feedback</li>
        <li>❌ Debating features internally instead of testing</li>
        <li>❌ Waiting for "perfect" before shipping</li>
        <li>❌ Adding features nobody asked for</li>
        <li>❌ Not tracking metrics week-over-week</li>
        <li>❌ Building everything the first user requests</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-6 border-2 border-green-200">
      <h4 class="font-bold text-green-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Good Signs
      </h4>
      <ul class="text-sm text-green-900 space-y-2">
        <li>✅ Shipping every week consistently</li>
        <li>✅ Users asking for features you just built</li>
        <li>✅ Killing features that don't get used</li>
        <li>✅ Weekly calls with 5-10 users</li>
        <li>✅ Metrics improving week-over-week</li>
        <li>✅ Building based on patterns, not one-offs</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Metrics to Track -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-purple-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-blue-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Core Metrics to Track Weekly</h3>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow">
        <h5 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Acquisition</h5>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
          <li>• New signups</li>
          <li>• Traffic sources</li>
          <li>• Conversion rate</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow">
        <h5 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Activation</h5>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
          <li>• Users who hit "aha moment"</li>
          <li>• Time to first value</li>
          <li>• Setup completion rate</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow">
        <h5 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Retention</h5>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
          <li>• Day 1 / Week 1 return rate</li>
          <li>• Weekly Active Users</li>
          <li>• Churn rate</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Weekly Review Template -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Weekly Review Template</h3>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">What did we ship this week?</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 italic">Example: Added onboarding checklist, improved signup flow, fixed critical bug</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-500 pl-4">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">What did we learn?</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 italic">Example: Users drop off at step 3 of onboarding. Need better explanation of value prop.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Key metrics this week vs last week</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 italic">Example: Signups: 12 → 18 (+50%), Activation: 33% → 45% (+12%), Retention: 40% → 42%</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-orange-500 pl-4">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">What are we testing next week?</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 italic">Example: Testing email drip campaign to improve Day 3 retention</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
